  "details": "Can't really find a solid pattern. Sometimes the game crashes when pressing join on someone, sometimes just at random. Today, I crashed three times within two minutes of launching the game. This isn't an \"everything froze\" crash, either; the Unity Crash Reporter appears immediately.\n\nAdding logs and crash dump. Only repro step I can find is trying to join some friends.\n\nLogs - https://pastebin.pl/view/a2a89f70\n\nCrash Dump - https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/kkwsae4p6juziiugnzc7j/crash.dmp?rlkey=ljgp5f4tr8n67v9gkzaliekf8&dl=0",
